{"version": 2, "width": 110, "height": 34, "timestamp": 1795369968, "title": "Lazy file system vs. pulling the whole image", "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.0, "o", "$ "]
[0.6, "o", "./demo.sh"]
[1.2, "o", "\r\n"]
[2.241014, "o", "== Uploading both images to the registry (each file is stored once, by its checksum)\r\n"]
[7.481441, "o", "  python:3.12-slim  4,416 files, 119.8 MB, of which 115.4 MB was new to the store\r\n"]
[10.623967, "o", "  python:3.11-slim  4,966 files, 125.5 MB, of which 33.7 MB was new to the store\r\n"]
[10.62614, "o", "\r\n== python:3.12-slim on localhost\r\nusual way: pull the whole image, unpack it, start the container\r\n"]
[11.297002, "o", "  downloaded the whole image (123.9 MB) and unpacked it\r\n"]
[11.429091, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[11.43731, "o", "  ready in 0.75 s\r\nusual way, second start (the image is already unpacked)\r\n"]
[11.568278, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[11.576367, "o", "  ready in 0.14 s\r\nlazy way: mount the image, start the container, fetch files as they're opened\r\n"]
[12.334634, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[12.361767, "o", "  ready in 0.76 s, downloaded 84 files, 22.5 MB (19% of the image), 2 opens served from the cache\r\n"]
[12.36179, "o", "lazy way, second start (the files it needs are in the local cache)\r\n"]
[12.677584, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[12.709025, "o", "  ready in 0.32 s, downloaded 0 files, 0.0 MB (0% of the image), 86 opens served from the cache\r\n"]
[12.709047, "o", "\r\n== python:3.12-slim over a simulated 1 Gbit/s link with 2 ms latency\r\nusual way\r\n"]
[13.892944, "o", "  downloaded the whole image (123.9 MB) and unpacked it\r\n"]
[14.049948, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[14.058287, "o", "  ready in 1.28 s\r\nlazy way\r\n"]
[15.641331, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[15.674647, "o", "  ready in 1.59 s, downloaded 84 files, 22.5 MB (19% of the image), 2 opens served from the cache\r\n\r\n== python:3.12-slim over a simulated 100 Mbit/s link with 10 ms latency\r\nusual way\r\n"]
[25.735149, "o", "  downloaded the whole image (123.9 MB) and unpacked it\r\n"]
[25.867403, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[25.875933, "o", "  ready in 10.14 s\r\nlazy way\r\n"]
[29.859275, "o", "  hello from python 3.12.16\r\n"]
[29.971821, "o", "  ready in 3.99 s, downloaded 84 files, 22.5 MB (19% of the image), 2 opens served from the cache\r\nlazy way, python:3.11-slim next on the same machine (files it shares with 3.12 are cached)\r\n"]
[32.320853, "o", "  hello from python 3.11.18\r\n"]
[32.349958, "o", "  ready in 2.35 s, downloaded 55 files, 7.2 MB (6% of the image), 33 opens served from the cache\r\n"]
